{"id":310,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen."},{"games":["Sword","Ultra Moon"],"text":"It stimulates its own muscles with electricity, so it can move quickly. It eases its soreness with electricity, too, so it can recover quickly as well."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Manectric can be found beneath unnatural thunderclouds. People say it can run at the same speed as lightning striking."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Manectric discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This Pokémon creates thunderclouds above its head."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Manectric is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this Pokémon creates thunderclouds."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Its nest can be found where a thunderbolt hits. It is discharging electricity from its mane."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Because lightning falls in their vicinities, MANECTRIC were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Static","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is charged with static electricity and may paralyze attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Lightning Rod","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon draws in all Electric-type moves. Instead of taking damage from them, its Sp. Atk stat is boosted."},{"name":"Minus","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":309,"name":"Electrike","condition":null,"children":[{"id":310,"name":"Manectric","condition":"Lv. 26","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,43],[1,86],[1,336],[1,424],[12,98],[16,351],[20,44],[24,422],[30,46],[36,435],[42,268],[48,528],[54,87],[60,604]],"machine":[97,213,34,242,598,604,486,203,263,424,53,416,63,304,423,231,113,315,182,706,240,156,496,184,214,555,173,164,129,168,87,422,86,85,253,521,528],"egg":[],"tutor":[804]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-89","name":"Manectric","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"89","artist":"HICO KIM","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-89/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-89/large"},{"id":"me5-24","name":"Manectric","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"24","artist":"Uninori","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-24/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-24/large"},{"id":"me1-50","name":"Mega Manectric ex","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"50","artist":null,"img":"me1/50"},{"id":"me1-158","name":"Mega Manectric ex","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Ultra Rare","number":"158","artist":null,"img":"me1/158"},{"id":"sv10-76","name":"Manectric","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"76","artist":null,"img":"sv10/76"},{"id":"swsh11-55","name":"Manectric","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare","number":"55","artist":"GIDORA","img":"swsh11/55"},{"id":"swsh4-52","name":"Manectric","set":"Vivid Voltage","date":"2020-11-13","rarity":"Rare","number":"52","artist":"SATOSHI NAKAI","img":"swsh4/52"},{"id":"swsh3-59","name":"Manectric","set":"Darkness Ablaze","date":"2020-08-14","rarity":"Rare","number":"59","artist":"nagimiso","img":"swsh3/59"},{"id":"sm7-52","name":"Manectric","set":"Celestial St